  "verse": "Already as individuals you create heavy destinies and great sorrows and problems which you carry into the world, and creating therewith hardship, misery and war as well as other terrible things, and indeed in complete forgottenness of your ample responsibility which you have to bear yourselves for all and everything and which also determines your destiny and that of the humankind in the good or evil, depending on whether you fulfil it or not; consider that you are your own destiny, because depending on whether you create good or evil in your thoughts and feelings, you will also be such in your self-created part of your inner nature.",
